# The retrieval layer verifies chunks.jsonl byte-for-byte against the SHA-256 in
# data/embeddings/embedding_manifest.json. Git must not normalise line endings in
# the corpus or the index: this repo is authored on Windows (CRLF) and deployed on
# Linux, and a normalised checkout hashes differently, which the integrity check
# correctly rejects as a stale index. Keeping these byte-exact is what lets the
# same index serve both platforms.
*.jsonl -text
*.npy -text binary

# Source and docs may normalise as usual.
*.py text
*.md text
*.toml text
*.txt text
*.csv text
